paragraph\" >With the help of your cheerful guide, it's time for your very first day on the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/c05a2b9a8a34459157910207a0851629.poster.avif?t=1787134684\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/c05a2b9a8a34459157910207a0851629.webm?t=1787134684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/c05a2b9a8a34459157910207a0851629.mp4?t=1787134684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/825b0a4761065248c7b6f1e85d495aff.avif?t=1787134684\" width=780 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every post serves a unique purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Handler handles recipes. The Sorter filters documents. The Reviewer sends unfinished work back for revision. They may look like ordinary office desks, but remove just one of them, and the entire department grinds to a halt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workflows don't build themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/acaa6a98ee60303bf46010c90daf2dbe.poster.avif?t=1787134684\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/acaa6a98ee60303bf46010c90daf2dbe.webm?t=1787134684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/acaa6a98ee60303bf46010c90daf2dbe.mp4?t=1787134684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/5cbfbe4ac5995727cdc2d6e88065fc4e.avif?t=1787134684\" width=780 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Posts need to be connected to build a complete workflow. Files enter from one side, get processed, and leave from another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every Post has limited connections and storage space. Once it gets overloaded, extra files will simply fall onto the floor then becoming trashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/aa6d5593543cd2dfa04236178de5000d.poster.avif?t=1787134684\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/aa6d5593543cd2dfa04236178de5000d.webm?t=1787134684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/aa6d5593543cd2dfa04236178de5000d.mp4?t=1787134684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/dee4f1299743b16bbaddcc81be1075b1.avif?t=1787134684\" width=780 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some employees are obsessive neat freaks.Some... somehow enjoy body odor.Conveniently, someone in the office smells terrible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every employee comes with their own abilities, personalities, and eccentricities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"