.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/1c2404a469c1cdb6ed6c30db335371cc.avif?t=1787134684\" width=780 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your company is only one piece of a much bigger business world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with neighboring companies to acquire rare resources, or take advantage of struggling competitors through corporate warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your market, Acquire their land, Grow your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business is about cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's also survival of the fittest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/fd038896b8aad9336de7c3a16d86677c.avif?t=1787134684\" width=780 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough generates a brand-new corporate world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New resources, New markets, New competitors waiting to be acquired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your company never truly reaches the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It just keeps getting bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironically, the larger your company becomes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The less work you actually have to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's capitalism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/extras/021ecf8d391ff2457ad43faf751ce3e5.avif?t=1787134684\" width=780 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every improvement made by HR reduces construction costs and increases operational efficiency in the CEO phase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expansion made by the CEO creates new challenges for HR to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch constantly between the microscopic chaos of managing people...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and the macroscopic satisfaction of managing an automated system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a company that eventually runs itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because in the end—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human Resources are, after all, just another kind of resource.</p>", "short_description": "The company is falling apart, and you're both the HR cleaning up the mess and the CEO profiting from it. Optimize people, rebuild workflows, automate production, and watch the numbers go up.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/1ef882f33702e272f1a678616aedeec043d6b2e6/header.jpg?t=1787134684", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/49dd2066ad6c7bb1125c752aada60a8e3fa3dd78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787134684", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821800/49dd2066ad6c7bb1125c752aada60a8e3fa3dd78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787134684", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-530 2.93GHZ 2-Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card, GTX 750 Ti 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> GPU must support Shader Model 5.0</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processo